From dd713185ec997c27adbf148609e1fc81da67c8a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Robinson <parobin@microsoft.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:33:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(chamfer): select minimum cone radius

Preserve the authored chamfer break while offsetting and lowering the ideal cone band across motion, project, UI, and MCP surfaces.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

Fixes #3153
